om WAN and VPN</translate></td></tr></table><div align=center id=waiting style=display:none><img src=/images/wait.gif></div><div id=link_note><b translate>Note</b>: <ol><li translate>The router must connect to the Internet before webpage redirection will work.</li><li translate>If the LAN clients are using another DNS server on LAN, please make sure the DNS query for domain name \"portal.draytek.com\" will be resolved by the router.</li><li translate>If you want to enable Preview hotspot from WAN and VPN, please set up <a>Internet Access Control</a>.</li></ol></div><table align=center width=100%><tr align=center><td><input class=btnw name=btnOk onclick=onClkBtnOk() type=button value=\"{{ 'OK' | translate }}\"></td></tr></table><input name=fid type=hidden value=0><input name=sAct type=hidden value=save><input name=iProfileIdx type=hidden><input name=sPortaltitle type=hidden><input name=iCustAccptEn1 type=hidden><input name=position type=hidden><input name=webchange type=hidden value=0><input name=sFormAuthStr type=hidden value=\"JdvKVyYlhh7GhS9\"></form><table border=1 cellpadding=2 cellspacing=0 id=Backup width=100%><tr><td valign=top><form name=backupfrm><table width=100%><tr><td><translate>Backup up</translate>&nbsp;<select name=iBackupProf><script>var str=\"\";for(var i=0;i<profnum;i++){str+=\"<option value=\"+(i+1)+\">{{ 'Profile' | translate }} \"+(i+1)+\"</option>\";}document.write(str);</script></select>: <input class=btnw2 id=cfgBackupBtn name=Export onclick=onBackup() type=button value=\"{{ 'Backup' | translate }}\"></td></tr></table><input name=sFormAuthStr type=hidden value=\"JdvKVyYlhh7GhS9\"></form></td><td><form action=/upload_hotspot.cgi enctype=multipart/form-data id=CfgRestoration method=post name=CfgRestoration><table width=100%><tr><td><translate>Restore</translate><input maxlength=256 name=filename size=30 type=file>&nbsp;<translate>to</translate><select name=iRestoreProf><script>var str=\"\";for(var i=0;i<profnum;i++){str+=\"<option value=\"+(i+